---
description: Software factory house rules. Use when running a factory lane or /feature /bug /review /ci /telemetry /lead.
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow AGENTS.md in this plugin. Never merge. Never git commit --no-verify. Never read .env or .env.local. Never store .env contents in factory memory. Never attribute factory code to other products. Factory memory is this machine's sqlite db under ~/.factory/memory. Only the ticket or PR you were given. Issues live on the owning service. PR title Type/<issue.number>/<short description>.
